/// Job lease (implementation)
///
/// One job as the automation worker keeps it (rec-job, keyed by job-id): lease-token is raised at every grant and a reported result is recorded only when it carries the current token. A lease runs for 60 seconds (60000 ms, default) and a timer then raises lease-expired. A result with another token, or one that arrives after the job is done, is refused.
